  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "거기, 젊은 트레이너.\n잠시 내 부탁을 들어주겠니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC70AE30002C0020C80AC7400020D2B8B808C774B108002E000AC7A0C2DC0020B0B40020BD80D0C1C7440020B4E4C5B4C8FCACA0B2C8003F00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 편지를 에투알 스쿨의\n교장에게 좀 전해 주면 좋겠는데.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020D3B8C9C0B97C0020C5D0D22CC54C0020C2A4CFE8C758000AAD50C7A5C5D0AC8C0020C8800020C804D5740020C8FCBA740020C88BACA0B294B370002E00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사정이 있어서\n직접 전해 줄 수 없는 상황이거든.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC815C7740020C788C5B4C11C000AC9C1C8110020C804D5740020C9040020C2180020C5C6B2940020C0C1D669C774AC70B4E0002E00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어떠니?\n나 대신 편지를 전해 주겠니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5A0B2C8003F000AB0980020B300C2E00020D3B8C9C0B97C0020C804D5740020C8FCACA0B2C8003F00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC544C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "수상한데요...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C218C0C1D55CB370C694002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "수상하다면 직접 편지를 전달해서\n확인해 보는 방법도 있다만...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C218C0C1D558B2E4BA740020C9C1C8110020D3B8C9C0B97C0020C804B2ECD574C11C000AD655C778D5740020BCF4B2940020BC29BC95B3C40020C788B2E4B9CC002E002E002E00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메르시! 딱 보자마자\n너라면 부탁을 들어줄 것 같았다니까.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54B974C2DC00210020B5310020BCF4C790B9C8C790000AB108B77CBA740020BD80D0C1C7440020B4E4C5B4C9040020AC830020AC19C558B2E4B2C8AE4C002E00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 편지를 전해 주면 돼.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020D3B8C9C0B97C0020C804D5740020C8FCBA740020B3FC002E00100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "전해야 할 사람은\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>에투알 스쿨<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>의 교장이니 잊지 말렴!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C804D574C57C0020D5600020C0ACB78CC740000A00100002FF000006C5D0D22CC54C0020C2A4CFE800100002FF000000C7580020AD50C7A5C774B2C80020C78AC9C00020B9D0B834002100100002011401A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어머 너는...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n전에는 반지를 찾아 준 트레이너구나.\n그때는 정말 고마웠어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4BA380020B108B294002E002E002E00100001BE01000AC804C5D0B2940020BC18C9C0B97C0020CC3EC5440020C9000020D2B8B808C774B108AD6CB098002E000AADF8B54CB2940020C815B9D00020ACE0B9C8C6E0C5B4002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 에투알 스쿨에는\n무슨 일로 온 거니?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C5D0D22CC54C0020C2A4CFE8C5D0B294000ABB34C2A80020C77CB85C0020C6280020AC70B2C8003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "교장 선생님을 찾고 있어요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD50C7A50020C120C0DDB2D8C7440020CC3EACE00020C788C5B4C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "편지를 전달하러 왔어요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3B8C9C0B97C0020C804B2ECD558B7EC0020C654C5B4C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "에투알 스쿨의 교장을 찾는 거라면\n바로 나란다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5D0D22CC54C0020C2A4CFE8C7580020AD50C7A5C7440020CC3EB2940020AC70B77CBA74000ABC14B85C0020B098B780B2E4002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001> 메모아에게\n중요한편지를 건넸다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100002190000010020BA54BAA8C544C5D0AC8C000AC911C694D55CD3B8C9C0B97C0020AC74B138B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 편지는 누구한테서 받은 거니...?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020D3B8C9C0B2940020B204AD6CD55CD14CC11C0020BC1BC7400020AC70B2C8002E002E002E003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아니, 그 전에...\n확인해 봐야 할 것이 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B2C8002C0020ADF80020C804C5D0002E002E002E000AD655C778D5740020BD10C57C0020D5600020AC83C7740020C788C5B4002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "베르 6번지에 있는\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>라시느건설<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>로 와 주겠니?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCA0B97400200036BC88C9C0C5D00020C788B294000A00100002FF000006B77CC2DCB290AC74C12400100002FF000000B85C0020C6400020C8FCACA0B2C8003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "와 줘서 고마워.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6400020C918C11C0020ACE0B9C8C6CC002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "와 줘서 고마워.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6400020C918C11C0020ACE0B9C8C6CC002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "혼자서 확인해야 할 일이지만\n네가 준 편지가 너무나도 기묘해서 말이야...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n우선 너에게도 편지의 내용을 알려 줄게.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D63CC790C11C0020D655C778D574C57C0020D5600020C77CC774C9C0B9CC000AB124AC000020C9000020D3B8C9C0AC000020B108BB34B098B3C40020AE30BB18D574C11C0020B9D0C774C57C002E002E002E00100001BE01000AC6B0C1200020B108C5D0AC8CB3C40020D3B8C9C0C7580020B0B4C6A9C7440020C54CB8240020C904AC8C002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "중요한 사실을 미처 전하지 못한 채\n그대를 떠나 버리게 되어 미안하오.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n14년 전, 어떤 남자에게\n소중한 반지의 수리를 부탁해 두었소.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n남자의 이름은 타라곤.\n라시느건설의 주인이오.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "죽은 남편에게서\n편지를 받는다는 건 말도 안 되는 일이니까...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n혼자서 확인하기 무서워서 부른 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C8FDC7400020B0A8D3B8C5D0AC8CC11C000AD3B8C9C0B97C0020BC1BB294B2E4B2940020AC740020B9D0B3C40020C5480020B418B2940020C77CC774B2C8AE4C002E002E002E00100001BE00000AD63CC790C11C0020D655C778D558AE300020BB34C11CC6CCC11C0020BD80B9780020AC70C57C002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신이 타라곤 씨?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0C7740020D0C0B77CACE40020C528003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇소만,\n여기에는 무슨 일로 오셨소?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C18CB9CC002C000AC5ECAE30C5D0B2940020BB34C2A80020C77CB85C0020C624C168C18C003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "혹시 14년 전에 어떤 남자가\n반지 수리를 맡기지 않았나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D639C2DC002000310034B1440020C804C5D00020C5B4B5A40020B0A8C790AC00000ABC18C9C00020C218B9ACB97C0020B9E1AE30C9C00020C54AC558B098C694003F00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇소.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C18C002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카나리의 생일을 축하하러\n레스토랑에 갔다가<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B098B9ACC7580020C0DDC77CC7440020CD95D558D558B7EC000AB808C2A4D1A0B791C5D00020AC14B2E4AC0000100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "옆 테이블의 남자와 마음이 잘 맞아서\n카나리와 같이 신나게 이야기를 나눴는데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6060020D14CC774BE14C7580020B0A8C790C6400020B9C8C74CC7740020C7980020B9DEC544C11C000ACE74B098B9ACC6400020AC19C7740020C2E0B098AC8C0020C774C57CAE30B97C0020B098B234B294B370002E002E002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 직업을 알게 된 남자가\n반지의 보석 장식을 고쳐 달라더군.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020C9C1C5C5C7440020C54CAC8C0020B41C0020B0A8C790AC00000ABC18C9C0C7580020BCF4C11D0020C7A5C2DDC7440020ACE0CCD00020B2ECB77CB354AD70002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부인과 함께 맞춘\n소중한 결혼반지라면서 말이오.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80C778ACFC0020D568AED80020B9DECD98000AC18CC911D55C0020ACB0D63CBC18C9C0B77CBA74C11C0020B9D0C774C624002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 남자는 제 남편이었어요.\n지금은 사고로...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF80020B0A8C790B2940020C81C0020B0A8D3B8C774C5C8C5B4C694002E000AC9C0AE08C7400020C0ACACE0B85C002E002E002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그것참 안타깝게 됐구려.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC83CC380020C548D0C0AE5DAC8C0020B410AD6CB824002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지만, 이제 와서 이곳에 찾아오다니,\n참으로 신기한 일이군.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0B9CC002C0020C774C81C0020C640C11C0020C774ACF3C5D00020CC3EC544C624B2E4B2C8002C000ACC38C73CB85C0020C2E0AE30D55C0020C77CC774AD70002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "일단 수리비는 드릴 테니...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C77CB2E80020C218B9ACBE44B2940020B4DCB9B40020D14CB2C8002E002E002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주시오, 마담.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC2DCC624002C0020B9C8B2F4002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "수리비는...\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, 자네와의 승부로 대신하지!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C218B9ACBE44B294002E002E002E000A0010000201000000002C0020C790B124C640C7580020C2B9BD80B85C0020B300C2E0D558C9C0002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "차고에서 기다리고 있을 테니\n준비가 되면 들어오게나!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC28ACE0C5D0C11C0020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788C7440020D14CB2C8000AC900BE44AC000020B418BA740020B4E4C5B4C624AC8CB098002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미안하지만 부탁할게.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 3032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8C548D558C9C0B9CC0020BD80D0C1D560AC8C002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 3064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그리 선생에게서 빵 만들기 외에\n포켓몬 승부도 배우고 있지!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그 성과를 자네에게 보여 주겠네!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9AC0020C120C0DDC5D0AC8CC11C0020BE750020B9CCB4E4AE300020C678C5D0000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B3C40020BC30C6B0ACE00020C788C9C0002100100001BE00000AADF80020C131ACFCB97C0020C790B124C5D0AC8C0020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCACA0B124002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이길 거예요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 3196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774AE380020AC70C608C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠시만요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 3212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0C2DCB9CCC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부를 해 주지 않는다면\n반지를 돌려줄 수 없네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 3224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80B97C0020D5740020C8FCC9C00020C54AB294B2E4BA74000ABC18C9C0B97C0020B3CCB824C9040020C2180020C5C6B124002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 파이트!\n레디, 고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020D30CC774D2B80021000AB808B514002C0020ACE0002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "몰드류, 몰드류, 몰드류!\n너의 드릴로 한 방 먹이는 거다!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAB0B4DCB958002C0020BAB0B4DCB958002C0020BAB0B4DCB9580021000AB108C7580020B4DCB9B4B85C0020D55C0020BC290020BA39C774B2940020AC70B2E4002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "과연 대단하군! 그렇지만 나와 몰드류도\n많이 성장한 것 같지 않나?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n자네에겐 여러모로 신세를 지고 있으니\n은혜를 갚을 수 있게 강해질 생각이라네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마담, 수리비는 받았으니\n맡고 있던 반지를 돌려드리겠소.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8B2F4002C0020C218B9ACBE44B2940020BC1BC558C73CB2C8000AB9E1ACE00020C788B3580020BC18C9C0B97C0020B3CCB824B4DCB9ACACA0C18C002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002E002E002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001>\n추억의반지를 건넸다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000010000219000001000ACD94C5B5C758BC18C9C0B97C0020AC74B138B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "남편도 잃고 반지도 잃은 채로\n여태까지 살았는데...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n결혼반지라도 모두 찾게 돼서 다행이야.\n추억과 함께 소중히 간직할게.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,\n내 반지를 찾아 준 것도 모자라<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n남편의 반지도 찾아 줘서\n진심으로 고마워.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C000AB0B40020BC18C9C0B97C0020CC3EC5440020C9000020AC83B3C40020BAA8C790B77C00100001BE01000AB0A8D3B8C7580020BC18C9C0B3C40020CC3EC5440020C918C11C000AC9C4C2ECC73CB85C0020ACE0B9C8C6CC002E00100002011401270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나도 맡고 있던 반지를\n제 주인에게 찾아 줘서 마음이 놓이는구려!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 4008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B3C40020B9E1ACE00020C788B3580020BC18C9C0B97C000AC81C0020C8FCC778C5D0AC8C0020CC3EC5440020C918C11C0020B9C8C74CC7740020B193C774B294AD6CB824002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿:",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 4092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기분 좋은 꿈을 꿨어.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n반지를 처음 받았을 때\n그이와 즐겁게 이야기를 나누는 꿈을...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕħ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
